Cross-chain storage earns you more! Walrus 2026 Multi-chain Interoperability Revenue Plan

Not just Sui chain! WalrusProtocol (@WalrusProtocol) 2026 upgrade "Cross-chain Data Storage Profit Sharing Plan," supports syncing on-chain data from public chains such as Polygon, Avalanche, etc. (like Ledger Data, blockchain records) to Walrus storage. Users can enjoy dual benefits of "basic cross-chain storage earnings + data authorization sharing." The annualized yield of cross-chain storage reaches 3.5%. If cross-chain data is authorized for use by dApps in the Linera ecosystem, an additional 10% of transaction fee sharing can be obtained. Currently, the average time for cross-chain data synchronization is 3.8 seconds, and users participating in cross-chain storage last quarter earned an average of 40% more than single-chain storage. Log in to the official website "Cross-chain Center" to bind your multi-chain wallet,

